# 01_sleep_onset.ledc — Sleep Onset (~45 min, then silent + dark, no loop)
# Goal: fall asleep. Continuous downward glide mirroring sleep architecture —
#       alpha entry (10 Hz) -> theta light-sleep (8->5 Hz) -> delta deep-sleep
#       (5->2->1 Hz), then a simultaneous Soft Off of light + audio.
# Bands: alpha 10->8 Hz -> theta 8->5 Hz -> delta 5->2->1 Hz.
# Safety: flicker <=10 Hz (never enters 15-25 Hz danger band); warm amber only
#         (no saturated red, no blue alternation); brightness capped <=30%;
#         LED brightness ramps IN over 10 s and fades to 0 (never an abrupt cut);
#         delta core sits in the SAFER <3 Hz zone.
#
# Format: LED line = time freq duty bright R G B mask
#         Audio   = A time freq pan volume mod channel freq_r wave_type
# Binaural beat is encoded by ramping the LEFT carrier `frequency` with a FIXED
# freq_r=255 (freq_r is NOT interpolatable). Perceived beat = 255 - frequency:
#   carrier 245->beat 10 | 247->8 | 250->5 | 253->2 | 254->1.
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start: the >/* prefix sits on the EARLIER entry,
# target = the next same-channel entry's value.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=0  Induction start (~10 Hz alpha). Warm amber. Brightness ramp-IN 0->band
#      over 10 s (safety). Binaural beat 10 Hz (L245 / R255). Volume fade-in.
0       >10 50 >0             255 100 0 255    # LED all-ch: 10 Hz flicker, bright 0-> over 10 s ramp-in, amber
A 0     >245 0 >0 0 1 255 0                    # ch1 binaural: L carrier 245 / R(freq_r) 255 = 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in start
A 0     0 0 >0 0 3 0 5                         # ch3 pink-noise bed (wave_type 5); vol fade-in start

# t=0:10  Brightness has reached the breathing band -> start breathing LFO
#         (sine 25<->30% over a 10 s period ~ 6 breaths/min). Induction only.
10000   >10 50 ~25:30:10000   255 100 0 255    # LED: hold 10 Hz, breathing brightness LFO 25<->30%

# t=0:30  Pink-noise fade-in complete (ch3 vol 18).
A 30000 0 0 18 0 3 0 5                         # ch3 pink-noise bed at steady 18

# t=0:45  Volume fade-in complete (ch1 -> 55). Carrier glide continues -> 247.
A 45000 >245.3 0 55 0 1 255 0                  # ch1 vol 55; carrier glides on toward 247 (beat shrinking 10->8)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=5:00  Deepening start. Beat 8 Hz (carrier 247). Breathing LFO ends; plain
#         brightness descent begins 30->15. LED flicker tracks beat -> 8 Hz.
300000  >8 50 >30            255 100 0 255     # LED: freq 8 Hz, bright 30->15 descent
A 300000 >247 0 55 0 1 255 0                   # ch1 beat 8 Hz; carrier glides toward 250

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=15:00  Deep descent. Beat 5 Hz (carrier 250). Color glide amber->deep-red
#          begins; brightness 15->5.
900000  >5 50 >15           >255 >100 >0 255   # LED: freq 5 Hz, bright 15->5, color 255,100,0 -> 180,30,0
A 900000 >250 0 55 0 1 255 0                   # ch1 beat 5 Hz; carrier glides toward 253

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=30:00  Delta fade start = SOFT OFF begins. Beat 2 Hz (carrier 253).
#          Quadratic volume fade 55->0; pink-noise quad fade 18->0; bright 5->0;
#          color glides toward dim deep-red.
1800000 >2 50 >5           >180 >30 >0 255     # LED: freq 2 Hz, bright 5->0, color 180,30,0 -> 150,20,0
A 1800000 >253 0 *55 0 1 255 0                 # ch1 beat 2 Hz; carrier glides toward 254; quad vol fade 55->0
A 1800000 0 0 *18 0 3 0 5                      # ch3 pink-noise quad fade 18->0

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# t=45:00  Soft Off complete. Beat 1 Hz (carrier 254). Brightness 0 AND volume 0
#          together -> silent + dark. No loop.
2700000 1 50 0             150 20 0 255        # LED: 1 Hz, bright 0, dim deep-red (off)
A 2700000 254 0 0 0 1 255 0                    # ch1 beat 1 Hz, vol 0
A 2700000 0 0 0 0 3 0 5                        # ch3 pink-noise vol 0
